              "mk-6cFebjis@3998"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch02.s10.p03.02",
            "text": "For example, a vector can use features such as \"has a tail\", \"is eatable\", \"has four legs\", \"makes sound\", and \"is a pet\", with high values when a feature applies.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "ghCSGRgVB_o@615",
              "ghCSGRgVB_o@618",
              "ghCSGRgVB_o@621",
              "ghCSGRgVB_o@626",
