              "mk-6cFebjis@4018"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch02.s10.p03.03",
            "text": "With this kind of representation, \"dog\" and \"cat\" are close to each other because similar dimensions have high or low values in both vectors.",
            "type": "F",
